WIRE.md §3.1: NaN, a leading zero, a control character in a string, trailing content and a
file truncated before a value are each one E7109 (eof or char, DECISIONS 208).
-- data/nan.json --
{"hp": NaN}
-- data/zero.json --
[01]
-- data/tab.json --
["a	b"]
-- data/trailing.json --
{} {}
-- data/truncated.json --
{"id": "IT_X", "price":
-- findings.txt --
error[E7109]  data/nan.json:1:8
  JSON syntax error: unexpected character "N"

error[E7109]  data/tab.json:1:4
  JSON syntax error: unexpected character "\t"

error[E7109]  data/trailing.json:1:4
  JSON syntax error: unexpected character "{"

error[E7109]  data/truncated.json:2:1
  JSON syntax error: unexpected end of input

error[E7109]  data/zero.json:1:3
  JSON syntax error: unexpected character "1"

5 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
